## Test naming

```
component:   describe('<ScreenName>', () => { it('shows <state> when <condition>') })  // TC-MCMP-NNN
device flow: .maestro/<workflow>.yaml   # TC-ME2E-NNN[, TC-ME2E-NNN]
platform:    .maestro/platform/<behaviour>.yaml   # TC-MPLT-NNN
```

## Iteration rules

- A failing test: diagnose the root cause, fix the component or the test, and rerun. Maximum 3 attempts.
- Never weaken an assertion, add `.skip`, or raise a timeout to make a test pass (see the
  develop-orchestrator Test Failure Recovery Guardrails).
- A test that passes only on retry is FLAKY. Report it with the retry count, never as PASS.

